{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26320","headline":"上礼部侍郎陈情 · 施肩吾","name":"上礼部侍郎陈情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九重城里无亲识，八百人中独姓施。\n弱羽飞时攒箭险，蹇驴行处薄冰危。\n晴天欲照盆难反，贫女如花镜不知。\n却向从来受恩地，再求青律变寒枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}